                "value": "simple, and hype. Write like as an author that is trying to conivce people the book is out. Super stoked and a really good story. Follow for more too.Be confident: this book is a banger and you know it."
              },
              {
                "id": "1ee088f7-7021-48c0-bcb7-d1011eb0db3d",
                "name": "inspiration",
                "type": "string",
                "value": "Topic: I just hit publish on KDP for my novel, Uncharted Faith.  The Hook: The Vibe: I wrote this because I was tired of boring thrillers. This is \"National Treasure\" meets \"The Work.\"  Call to Action: It's live on Amazon now. Go read it."
              }
